The [[Red Orchid Collar]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Accessory]], which is an upgrade of the [[Acorn Collar]], normally obtained by catalytically converting the [[Acorn Collar]] using a [[Blood Amulet]]. The other upgrades of the [[Acorn Collar]] (the [[Blue Sage Collar]] and [[White Lily Collar]]) can also be converted to the [[Red Orchid Collar]] in the same way.

Like all collar items, it cares about {{icon/luck}}, in this case giving the items around it lifesteal for each {{icon/luck}}. It also gives those items critical chance for each {{icon/vampirism}}. 

This bonus is useful for buffing the damage of nearby weapons or other damaging items and gaining life from them, and will be stronger the higher the {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/vampirism}} of the player, as well as stronger the more damaging the nearby items are.

The [[Acorn Ace]] skill gives the [[Red Orchid Collar]] and the other collars more {{icon/star}} slots.
